::node[public_action]
->[:role=skill]
->[:scope=all]
->[:keywords=public, open, unrestricted]
::dense
public_action|available to all agent roles
::full
This node is visible to every agent role including worker and orchestrator.
Scope is set to "all" so no role-based filtering applies.

::node[restricted_step]
->[:role=skill]
->[:scope=orchestrator]
->[:keywords=restricted, orchestrator, privileged]
::dense
restricted_step|orchestrator-only|hidden from worker agents
::full
This node is restricted to the orchestrator role.
Worker agents must not see this node in their filtered view.
It represents a privileged operation that requires elevated trust.
